#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:14 86745c0e61734fbf8d38b174da1ecbb0
msgid ""
"This article explains how to setup the TradHelicopter in the mission "
"planner."
msgstr "本文介绍了如何在 Mission Planner 中设置传统直升机模拟器。"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:18 808549482f4e4a9ea3ccd1d9a4bd6d9a
msgid "What you need"
msgstr "所需材料"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:20 4d36b87f0a7c4bf09c46b5ca7ccc4204
msgid ""
"AeroSIM-RC 3.7 http://www.aerosimrc.com/j/index.php/en/downloads. Note: As "
"of Feb 20th 2012, you need to use the beta version of 3.83 which can be "
"found `here <http://www.aerosimrc.com/downloads/AeroSIMRC_3.83-3.81.exe>`__."
msgstr ""
"AeroSIM-RC 3.7 http://www.aerosimrc.com/j/index.php/en/downloads。注意：截至 2012 "
"年 2 月 20 日，您需要使用 3.83 的 Beta 版本，可从 `这里 "
"<http://www.aerosimrc.com/downloads/AeroSIMRC_3.83-3.81.exe>`__ 下载。"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:24 59692f89d74c4af486d77c68224720b1
msgid ""
"`AP Mission Planner v 1.0.84+ <https://code.google.com/archive/p/ardupilot-"
"mega/downloads>`__"
msgstr ""
"`AP Mission Planner v 1.0.84+ <https://code.google.com/archive/p/ardupilot-"
"mega/downloads>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:26 20821f4ca3a948819d8b1c5f4fe95e89
msgid ""
"In your AP Mission Planner installation directory you will find a file "
"called AeroSIMRCAPMHIL.zip. Extract this to your AeroSIM-RC plug-ins "
"directory (i.e. C:Program Files (x86)AeroSIM-RCplugin)"
msgstr ""
"在您的 AP Mission Planner 安装目录中，您会找到一个名为 AeroSIMRCAPMHIL.zip 的文件。将其解压到 AeroSIM-"
"RC 插件目录（即 C:Program Files (x86)AeroSIM-RCplugin）"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:31 f6f6c576c700468fb2ba4ecb072bcfb3
msgid "How to make it work"
msgstr "使用方法"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:33 de417c589d304b8c9721a0e48cffa7fa
msgid "Upload the Copter firmware using the Mission Planner."
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 上传 Copter 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:35 e510f9448c084cd0acfab947ba2e917c
msgid ""
"On the AP Mission Planner you can find the Heli button on the bottom left of"
" the firmware upload screen."
msgstr "在 AP Mission Planner 固件上传界面的左下角可以找到 Heli 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:41 be578ed1a1a04a558c45b1b6e8312f7c
msgid ""
"If you use Arduino be sure to set the following definitions in "
"APM_Config.h:\\*"
msgstr "如果您使用 Arduino，请确保在 APM_Config.h 中设置以下定义：\\*"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:48 f7ebe9ce98e34840871b7b183275f8c1
msgid "Start the AP Mission Planner and perform the following set-up:"
msgstr "启动 AP Mission Planner 并进行以下设置："

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:50 a42983e7f69f4e62896eb38f0d2cc2be
msgid "select Simulation from the Menu"
msgstr "从菜单中选择 Simulation"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:51 41c0a6145896436e9eef2a0e38c5eab8
msgid "check AeroSimRC"
msgstr "勾选 AeroSimRC"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:52 c76b14aabd304d6ba36ff71d153284b4
msgid "check Heli"
msgstr "勾选 Heli"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:53 7f52451ad4fc4748aba26435d795942b
msgid "check Reverse Rudder and Display All"
msgstr "勾选 Reverse Rudder 和 Display All"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:54 5f7af4037a9e4dc593f883e738675123
msgid "set Roll gain = 4500"
msgstr "设置横滚增益 = 4500"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:55 7d1faa778bf34efcad7c9d27605f7543
msgid "set Pitch gain = 4500"
msgstr "设置俯仰增益 = 4500"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:56 d644370a7f9e4d138a4cbb6e37999d77
msgid "set Throttle gain = 4500"
msgstr "设置油门增益 = 4500"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:57 6b9f4edcc8ec4c5e95e30f7e9c9f6004
msgid "set Rudder gain = 300"
msgstr "设置方向舵增益 = 300"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:58 0159ead24f094bc090481478d74ceaf7
msgid "select Save Settings so that you don't need to this next time"
msgstr "选择 Save Settings，以便下次无需重复设置"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:59 37346e9f7166463681fd88943eda2c9c
msgid "connect your APM to you PC through the USB port"
msgstr "通过 USB 端口将 APM 连接到 PC"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:60 5c8707fa35694f2a8ed36340950deab2
msgid ""
"ensure the COM port and baud is correct in the APMissionPlanner and push the"
" Connect button"
msgstr "确保 APMissionPlanner 中的 COM 端口和波特率设置正确，然后点击 Connect 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:62 de73983768dd402eb3fd86fcc63c76c4
msgid "push SimLink Start/Stop button, you should see \"Sim Link Started\""
msgstr "点击 SimLink Start/Stop 按钮，您应该看到\"Sim Link Started\""

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:67 2c2da0415ed24e76ba32e3c875ad516f
msgid "Start AeroSIM-RC and perform the following setup"
msgstr "启动 AeroSIM-RC 并进行以下设置"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:69 8ad0fd31392e4bee82a6406c920d5843
msgid "select SIM, Select Model, Heli 30 from the menu"
msgstr "从菜单中选择 SIM、Select Model、Heli 30"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:70 7cb437fbe5de479fb2f9e93738566f26
msgid "select plug-ins, APM from the menu"
msgstr "从菜单中选择 plug-ins、APM"

#: ../../source/docs/tradhelihil.rst:71 e92729c58f3a4a7395ee47b5a97279db
msgid ""
"you should find the engines in the RC helicopter immediately start and that "
"you are able to control the RC heli much like the real helicopter"
msgstr "您应该会发现 RC 直升机的发动机立即启动，并且您能够像控制真实直升机一样控制 RC 直升机"
